# Leaf crown (#421): the decor kind `crown`, native 96x40, one frame, hung from the room top (its top edge on the
# room's top edge). It tops a `Decor:trunk` standing under its middle (trunk object x = crown x + 40): the middle lobe
# hangs to the last row and hides the trunk's rounded cap. Leaf clusters with lighter tops and darker undersides.
# Decor tier (D76): the bush's muted grey-green family, one step lighter than the bush (over the map background 4a92b8,
# D92: outline 0.087 against the bush palette's 0.157, ceiling 0.20); contour 607660 in its own darker green, no ink 0b0814,
# no violet (violet is the FallingBranch's bud accent). Not solid, never moves.
size 96 40
color k 607660
color d 6e8466
color m 7b9170
color l 889e79
color n 948f62
frame crown
